# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrate from `BackendV1` to `BackendV2` {#migrate-from-backendv1-to-backendv2}"
msgstr "Migrasi dari `BackendV1` ke `BackendV2` {#migrate-from-backendv1-to-backendv2}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Qiskit [`BackendV1`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.providers.BackendV1) class has been deprecated and will be removed from service. This migration guide describes the small adjustments you need to make if you use a provider that upgraded from [`BackendV1`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.providers.BackendV1) to [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2).\n"
msgstr ""
"Kelas Qiskit [`BackendV1`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.providers.BackendV1) telah didepresiasi dan akan dihapus\n"
"dari layanan. Panduan migrasi ini menjelaskan penyesuaian kecil yang perlu Anda lakukan jika menggunakan provider yang sudah diperbarui\n"
"dari [`BackendV1`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.providers.BackendV1) ke\n"
"[`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
" If you exclusively use `qiskit_ibm_runtime` and `qiskit_aer`, no action is needed.  The `qiskit_ibm_runtime` package has always used `BackendV2`, and `qiskit_aer` has used `BackendV2` since version 0.13.\n"
" </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
" Jika Anda hanya menggunakan `qiskit_ibm_runtime` dan `qiskit_aer`, tidak ada tindakan yang perlu dilakukan. Paket `qiskit_ibm_runtime`\n"
"selalu menggunakan `BackendV2`, dan `qiskit_aer` sudah menggunakan `BackendV2` sejak versi 0.13.\n"
" </Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "High-level changes in `BackendV2` {#high-level-changes-in-backendv2}"
msgstr "Perubahan utama di `BackendV2` {#high-level-changes-in-backendv2}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Qiskit [`Backend`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.Backend) model was designed to provide the Qiskit SDK with an abstraction\n"
"layer that enabled reasoning about quantum computers within the scope of the SDK. The first iteration of the model was introduced with the\n"
"[`BackendV1`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.providers.BackendV1) class. This class stored the backend information in a series\n"
"of data containers, namely the [`BackendConfiguration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.providers.models.BackendConfiguration) and\n"
"[`BackendProperties`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.providers.models.BackendProperties) classes.\n"
msgstr ""
"Model Qiskit [`Backend`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.Backend) dirancang untuk menyediakan lapisan abstraksi\n"
"kepada Qiskit SDK yang memungkinkan penalaran tentang komputer kuantum dalam lingkup SDK. Iterasi pertama model ini diperkenalkan melalui\n"
"kelas [`BackendV1`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.providers.BackendV1). Kelas ini menyimpan informasi backend dalam\n"
"serangkaian kontainer data, yaitu kelas\n"
"[`BackendConfiguration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.providers.models.BackendConfiguration) dan\n"
"[`BackendProperties`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.providers.models.BackendProperties).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) class redefined\n"
"user access for most backend properties to make them work with native Qiskit data structures and have flatter\n"
"access patterns. The core of the [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) model is the\n"
"[`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) class, a representation of the QPU that contains the transpilation constraints that Qiskit can use to optimize circuits for execution.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kelas [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) mendefinisikan ulang akses pengguna untuk sebagian\n"
"besar properti backend agar bisa bekerja dengan struktur data Qiskit native dan memiliki pola akses yang lebih datar. Inti dari model\n"
"[`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) adalah kelas\n"
"[`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target), sebuah representasi QPU yang berisi batasan transpilasi yang\n"
"bisa digunakan Qiskit untuk mengoptimalkan Circuit untuk eksekusi.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Qiskit SDK has been updated to work exclusively with [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) inputs,\n"
"and most providers have upgraded from [`BackendV1`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.providers.BackendV1) to [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2). It is expected that existing providers will deprecate the old access where possible to provide a graceful migration, but eventually users will need to adjust their code.\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit SDK telah diperbarui untuk bekerja secara eksklusif dengan input\n"
"[`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2), dan sebagian besar provider sudah diperbarui dari\n"
"[`BackendV1`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.providers.BackendV1) ke\n"
"[`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2). Diharapkan bahwa provider yang sudah ada akan\n"
"mendepresiasi akses lama di mana memungkinkan untuk memberikan migrasi yang mulus, namun pada akhirnya pengguna perlu menyesuaikan kode\n"
"mereka.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The principle behind [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) is\n"
"that most of the information about a backend is contained in its\n"
"[`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) object, and the backend's attributes often query\n"
"its `BackendV2.target` attribute to return information. However, in many cases the attributes only provide\n"
"a subset of information that the target can contain. For example, `backend.coupling_map`\n"
"returns a [`CouplingMap`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.CouplingMap) constructed from the\n"
"[`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) accessible in the\n"
"`BackendV2.target` attribute. However, the target might contain\n"
"instructions that operate on more than two qubits (which can't be represented in a\n"
"[`CouplingMap`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.CouplingMap)) or it might have instructions that only operate on\n"
"a subset of qubits (or two qubit links, for a two qubit instruction), which won't be\n"
"detailed in the full coupling map returned by\n"
"`BackendV2.coupling_map`. So depending on your use case,\n"
"it might be necessary to look deeper than just the equivalent access with\n"
"[`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2).\n"
msgstr ""
"Prinsip di balik [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) adalah bahwa sebagian besar informasi\n"
"tentang sebuah backend terdapat dalam objek [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target)-nya, dan atribut\n"
"backend sering kali mengkueri atribut `BackendV2.target`-nya untuk mengembalikan informasi. Namun, dalam banyak kasus atribut hanya\n"
"memberikan sebagian informasi yang bisa dikandung target. Misalnya, `backend.coupling_map` mengembalikan objek\n"
"[`CouplingMap`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.CouplingMap) yang dibangun dari\n"
"[`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) yang dapat diakses di atribut `BackendV2.target`. Namun,\n"
"target mungkin mengandung instruksi yang beroperasi pada lebih dari dua qubit (yang tidak bisa direpresentasikan dalam\n"
"[`CouplingMap`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.CouplingMap)) atau mungkin memiliki instruksi yang hanya\n"
"beroperasi pada sebagian qubit (atau dua tautan qubit, untuk instruksi dua qubit), yang tidak akan diperinci dalam coupling map lengkap\n"
"yang dikembalikan oleh `BackendV2.coupling_map`. Jadi tergantung pada kasus penggunaanmu, mungkin perlu untuk melihat lebih dalam dari\n"
"sekadar akses ekuivalen dengan [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specific changes in `BackendV2` {#specific-changes-in-backendv2}"
msgstr "Perubahan spesifik di `BackendV2` {#specific-changes-in-backendv2}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Most attributes have a direct replacement, simplifying the migration efforts. The only point of mismatch between interfaces is in the [`CouplingMap`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.CouplingMap).\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebagian besar atribut memiliki pengganti langsung, sehingga menyederhanakan upaya migrasi. Satu-satunya titik ketidakcocokan antara\n"
"antarmuka adalah pada [`CouplingMap`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.CouplingMap).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Following is a table of example access patterns in [`BackendV1`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.providers.BackendV1) and the new form\n"
"with [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2).\n"
msgstr ""
"Berikut adalah tabel contoh pola akses di [`BackendV1`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.providers.BackendV1) dan bentuk\n"
"barunya dengan [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2).\n"

